{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/583835-anyone-demon-books","id":583835,"title":"Anyone Demon books ?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-08T14:29:09-07:00","id":583835,"title":"Anyone Demon books ?","content":"Hello everyone I wanted to know will there be any more demon books ?<br /> <br /> I was hoping for some more books with embeds and exploits. If there will be another book will it give players more hits on trad-craft ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-08T14:30:28-07:00","id":583855,"title":"","content":"Storytellers Guide, Swords of Heaven. Beyond that, no idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-08T14:31:55-07:00","id":583859,"title":"","content":"Beyond demon books. Do you think there will be City books ?<br /> <br /> As in just books that cover city's giving information how each splat views them ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-08T14:42:02-07:00","id":583863,"title":"","content":"Well, there's already <b>Flowers of Hell</b> for new Embeds and Exploits, and <b>Splintered City: Seattle</b> has a chapter on how the other major splats besides demons operate in the city. The <b>Demon Seed Collection</b> is organized by shorter views of several other cities as viewed by the God-Machine and the Unchained, in a similar style to the city chapters in the new 2e cores like Vampire and Werewolf. If you don't already have <b>Seattle</b> I'll absolutely recommend it, it's not without flaws but I found it one of the best books on a single city in the nWoD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-08T17:34:40-07:00","id":584009,"title":"","content":"What sorts of things would folks like to see in the Demon line? I'm hearing trade craft and (of course) more cool powers. The Translation Guide has a bunch of new powers, including form powers, which I hope makes it worth checking out even if you're not planning to mix up the two Demons in other ways. Storytellers Guide will have a lot of other cool things (I can't say a ton more than that on the subject just yet, but I'm pretty pumped to see that in print). What is the game missing?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-08T19:11:32-07:00","id":584067,"title":"","content":"Some more on the Analysts would be really good. They're neat as an Incarnation, but it would be nice to see them fleshed out a bit more. All of the other Incarnations are pretty solid!<br /> <br /> Tradecraft is indeed wonderful - there's a lot involved in espionage but the means and the way it happens is very different depending on period. The cold war era paranoid spycraft (which feels like the heart of the game) is very different to modern espionage and the world of cybersecurity, which is very different to early industrial era spycraft. I imagine all the more classic era stuff gets covered in the Dark Ages chapters (I can't even remember what Demon got for that now... Edit: WW2, Ottoman Conquest and Russian Revolution)<br /> <br /> Although I'm going to assume it's in pride of place in the Storyteller's guide, more guidance on the Cipher would be wonderful. It's probably the hardest thing to wrap one's head around from both a ST and a Player perspective. Especially in the areas of the 'Final Truth' and building interlocks.<br /> <br /> Finally, more weird science! I like weird science and I can usually come up with ideas but I need all the help I can get! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1462,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","user":"Xenesis","date":". 07-08-2015, 10:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-09T04:58:37-07:00","id":584525,"title":"","content":"Thinking for a moment on what I wouldn't mind another pass on, I think what ties them together is that they're &quot;endgame&quot; stuff, like Changeling's Equinox Road or Mage's Imperial Mysteries \u2014 the stuff you begin to see from an especially experienced and insightful demon. In particular, I think hacking infrastructure could use another pass; there's comparatively little in Flowers of Hell to support setting out to hijack a project to a particular intended result (what it calls &quot;subversion hacks&quot;), let alone demons who might get up to trying to arrange occult matrices on their own. And while the Storyteller's Guide isn't out yet to establish what depth it goes into practical means of forging different sorts of Hells, that also seems like something that could use more direct support, especially alternative dimensional spaces and the stories that can emerge from a demon's Hell once it's forged, whether centered around the Hell-forger or another demon finding that space (and potentially disagreeing with the execution).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-09T21:30:19-07:00","id":585635,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/583835-anyone-demon-books?p=583855#post583855\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> ... Swords of Heaven...</div> </div> </div> </div>That's the first time I've heard that term, is it the working title for the STG?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-09T21:42:24-07:00","id":585643,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Agentwestmer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/583835-anyone-demon-books?p=585635#post585635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's the first time I've heard that term, is it the working title for the STG?</div> </div> </div> </div>It would be kind of a waste not to complete <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/219423-why-flowers-of-hell?p=219450#post219450\">the Moorcock reference the PG started.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-10T07:24:32-07:00","id":586065,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Agentwestmer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/583835-anyone-demon-books?p=585635#post585635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's the first time I've heard that term, is it the working title for the STG?</div> </div> </div> </div>Rose mentioned it ages ago as a separate book from STG.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-10T12:10:39-07:00","id":586314,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xenesis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/583835-anyone-demon-books?p=584067#post584067\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tradecraft is indeed wonderful - there's a lot involved in espionage but the means and the way it happens is very different depending on period. The cold war era paranoid spycraft (which feels like the heart of the game) is very different to modern espionage and the world of cybersecurity, which is very different to early industrial era spycraft. I imagine all the more classic era stuff gets covered in the Dark Ages chapters (I can't even remember what Demon got for that now... Edit: WW2, Ottoman Conquest and Russian Revolution)</div> </div> </div> </div>If you want a good RPG book with a lot of info on Tradecraft, its not a OPP Book but The Agents Handbook from the Laundry Roleplaying Game has great chapters on tradecraft, Its worth a read from anyone interested in an espionage game, even if the rules in it do not transfer to Demon.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.amazon.com/Laundry-Files-Agents-Handbook-Laundy/dp/0857440535/ref=sr_1_1?ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1436555339&amp;sr=8-1&amp;keywords=Agents+handbook+the+laundry+rpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.amazon.com/Laundry-Files-Agents-Handbook-Laundy/dp/0857440535/ref=sr_1_1?ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1436555339&amp;sr=8-1&amp;keywords=Agents+handbook+the+laundry+rpg\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.amazon.com/Laundry-Files-Agents-Handbook-Laundy/dp/0857440535/ref=sr_1_1?ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1436555339&amp;sr=8-1&amp;keywords=Agents+handbook+the+laundry+rpg\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.amazon.com/Laundry-Files-Agents-Handbook-Laundy/dp/0857440535/ref=sr_1_1?ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1436555339&amp;sr=8-1&amp;keywords=Agents+handbook+the+laundry+rpg </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5718-hackthulhu","name":"Hackthulhu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5718_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-11T10:57:45-07:00","id":587246,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Zawadzki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/583835-anyone-demon-books?p=584009#post584009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What sorts of things would folks like to see in the Demon line? I'm hearing trade craft and (of course) more cool powers. The Translation Guide has a bunch of new powers, including form powers, which I hope makes it worth checking out even if you're not planning to mix up the two Demons in other ways. Storytellers Guide will have a lot of other cool things (I can't say a ton more than that on the subject just yet, but I'm pretty pumped to see that in print). What is the game missing?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd like to see an Infinite Macabre (space opera) shard for Demon, and a Tokyo Seed.<br /> <br /> It might be neat to have a book on playable Angels. Maybe the G-M was able to take some Integrators and Exiles, and turn them into a new software release of Angels, who have limited free will.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-15T09:59:37-07:00","id":591422,"title":"","content":"Keep your eye on the Onyx Path blog today.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}